  "description": "Technical trails, steep climbs and full e-MTB flow – the Copperhead EVO AM 4 offers you the full range of all-mountain action. Equipped with a particularly powerful suspension, top components and powered by the powerful Bosch Performance Line CX drive, it will support you in all off-road challenges. Trail tour, Alpine cross or fitness lap – you decide where the path takes you.\n\nThe monocoque carbon frame and Rock Shox suspension with 160/150 mm travel and innovative 4-link swingarm technology provide the necessary conditions for maximum off-road performance. Increased stiffness gives you improved control on descents and greater efficiency on climbs.\n\nOther highlights include Rumble Impeller wheels, wireless Sram XX1 Eagle AXS shifting and RockShox Reverb Dropper Post. The Copperhead EVO AM 4 also features integrated lighting with MonkeyLink cornering lights and Twinlights in the dropouts – for visibility and visibility on the trail and on the way home.",
